{"lines":[{"w":0.30404673258463544,"y":0.0054940028282163267,"t":"@MirsIELTS","h":0.035523622225871132,"c":1,"x":0.0081409046544044135},{"c":1,"x":0.67761806434622096,"w":0.23408625284830742,"h":0.016025245013841838,"y":0.04651162801095543,"t":"Sample Writing answers"},{"x":0.073921976214675264,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 2","y":0.094395280544104287,"c":1,"w":0.35934290568033855,"h":0.020430301002344886},{"x":0.073921974063394486,"y":0.13067846602171929,"h":0.016224188790560423,"w":0.69199178059895827,"c":1,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score."},{"h":0.018918501592315451,"x":0.071868571150372804,"t":"I personally disagree with the issue whether the working days should be one day less. By no means","y":0.15840707930281761,"c":1,"w":0.82546203613281244},{"c":1,"y":0.1787610617608677,"h":0.020366845370042297,"t":"should we make the weekend three days long. There are two aspects that support my point of view.","x":0.071868571153593824,"w":0.82546203613281266},{"y":0.20543071792836698,"w":0.78455673217773447,"h":0.022468508380000918,"x":0.073841329494300487,"c":1,"t":"First of all, now all over the world are facing an unprecedented economic recession caused by"},{"c":1,"x":0.073819871844608448,"y":0.22561854427572203,"t":"COVID-19. Many factories are forced to close and the shops shut down. The economic loss is","h":0.022028776185702426,"w":0.77228530883789059},{"c":1,"h":0.01900510984887771,"x":0.071868582689004659,"t":"substantial. Nevertheless, with the advent of vaccine, I perceive that now people can go back to","y":0.24854651212241641,"w":0.78850102742513029},{"y":0.26889534933080594,"h":0.019010255751708227,"w":0.83572896321614576,"c":1,"t":"their work. This would certainly be conducive to our economy. If we reduce one day from work, even","x":0.071868577846953205},{"t":"just from a week, it would cause repercussions on our society in terms of the development","y":0.28924418653945316,"c":1,"w":0.75770019531249999,"x":0.067761811917091283,"h":0.01901540052925943},{"w":0.1037307612101237,"x":0.071492670240472955,"t":"ot economy.","y":0.31162484170284355,"h":0.01615408500738913,"c":1},{"y":0.33864306729442095,"w":0.75975357055664061,"h":0.018915071740614575,"c":1,"x":0.071868594493233032,"t":"Secondly, I am used to do my leisure activities in Saturday and Sunday. If there is one day"},{"t":"more, I would wonder what to do on that day, and that means I have to rearrange my weekend","y":0.35899705040633134,"x":0.071868576286410454,"h":0.018909925837783947,"c":1,"w":0.78644765218098966},{"t":"plans. I think it would be tiring. Most importantly, I come to admit that, too some degree, I am a","x":0.073853579327816596,"w":0.80506128946940114,"h":0.021493931998193716,"y":0.37910064086259587,"c":1},{"y":0.39931504600727252,"h":0.021655919347892461,"x":0.071782626629403226,"c":1,"t":"workanolic. I cannot even image if I am separated from my favourite place - my office. It is the","w":0.79278340657552093},{"c":1,"x":0.073921970820785915,"y":0.42151162840080703,"w":0.78850102742513029,"h":0.018901351208532091,"t":"place where I retreat to when I feel anxious and want to get rid of everything. Working, indeed,"},{"w":0.82546203613281255,"h":0.020381423365049889,"y":0.44186046495580267,"t":"gives me a sense of achievement and contentment. I, therefore, would oppose to the idea of cutting","x":0.071868571169370149,"c":1},{"w":0.1458508555094401,"c":1,"h":0.020566451936344876,"t":"one working day.","x":0.071838433514002986,"y":0.46210049414640175},{"w":0.79671457926432288,"h":0.019023975158511397,"c":1,"t":"Though some people may argue that they need one day more in the week to reduce their stress","x":0.07186858294967019,"y":0.49115044294598009},{"x":0.071868571393996022,"w":0.83367558797200525,"c":1,"t":"from work, it could be harmful to our economic growth in this harsh time. Also, I believe that many","h":0.019018830380960194,"y":0.51150442493297343},{"x":0.071868589133131683,"t":"people are used to the current working system, which provides two days for break. The sudden","c":1,"y":0.5318584073904371,"h":0.020467174158687151,"w":0.79055440266927091},{"x":0.071868570630294268,"w":0.80903493245442692,"c":1,"h":0.018987102002169243,"t":"change will make people confused. Unless the government enacts a comprehensive policy for this","y":0.55368731610278576},{"c":1,"x":0.071868594701145885,"y":0.57256637223830342,"w":0.75975357055664061,"h":0.020456883478305321,"t":"new system, I think the idea does not work, and it would surely brings chaos in our society."},{"y":0.61032448355904101,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","h":0.014749262536873253,"x":0.073921968301630489,"w":0.31211499532063802},{"c":1,"w":0.76602422078450516,"y":0.63797636389391488,"t":"In this good response, the candidate presents their opinion at the start, then gives","x":0.11698186311418113,"h":0.020497583709986889},{"h":0.017486451298086347,"x":0.11909651358539984,"t":"two main points about why the current working week should not change: economic","y":0.65693215329460741,"w":0.7741272989908855,"c":1},{"t":"development and the disruption to our existing pattern of a two-day weekend. In the","w":0.78028747558593747,"y":0.67581120933218619,"h":0.01604925566366644,"c":1,"x":0.11909650853420449},{"h":0.017540474838211861,"c":1,"y":0.69321533908614097,"t":"final paragraph, they consider the other side of the argument and people who might","x":0.11909651490435351,"w":0.7823408508300782},{"t":"like an additional day off. (However, a counter argument is not necessary for this","y":0.71061946893153627,"x":0.11909652035339907,"h":0.017699115044247815,"c":1,"w":0.75154001871744791},{"y":0.72965116289278453,"w":0.16427104949951171,"t":"type of question.)","x":0.1190965080561386,"h":0.016071550825000891,"c":1},{"w":0.77412729899088539,"y":0.75870206494668468,"x":0.11909651466981529,"h":0.017460725722411419,"c":1,"t":"Overall, ideas are presented in a clear order, and there is some good use of linking"},{"t":"words and expressions [First of all | Nevertheless | Most importantly | Unless].","w":0.72895278930664065,"h":0.017498456341678792,"c":1,"x":0.11909650058157828,"y":0.77610619479015108},{"x":0.11909650485221684,"w":0.66529774983723966,"c":1,"h":0.016027817402617384,"t":"The response contains some good vocabulary with effective collocation","y":0.80668604662682741},{"x":0.11704311323768081,"c":1,"w":0.75359344482421875,"y":0.82412790699997718,"h":0.017465013599677115,"t":"[unprecedented economic recession | conducive to | sense of achievement], and"},{"t":"131","h":0.013081394746943587,"c":1,"w":0.036960986455281675,"y":0.92296511653913726,"x":0.86858316170049055},{"h":0.04166666666666663,"c":1,"t":"IELTSXpress.com","x":0.51176470218237247,"y":0.94166666658950615,"w":0.45294118245442705}],"w":2400,"h":3390}